                          description="Derived Column Expression"
                          name="Expression">[ISNULL](#{Package\Data Flow Task\OLE DB Source.Outputs[OLE DB Source Output].Columns[full_date]}) ? NULL(DT_I4) : ([YEAR](#{Package\Data Flow Task\OLE DB Source.Outputs[OLE DB Source Output].Columns[full_date]}) * 10000 + [MONTH](#{Package\Data Flow Task\OLE DB Source.Outputs[OLE DB Source Output].Columns[full_date]}) * 100 + [DAY](#{Package\Data Flow Task\OLE DB Source.Outputs[OLE DB Source Output].Columns[full_date]}))</property>
